ATTRIBUTION AND PROVENANCE
This dataset is derived in part from a frozen snapshot of Papers with Code, which is
distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0. Any use of this dataset must also credit Papers with
Code. The ShareAlike term is inherited from that source. The specific frozen snapshot
(dated 2025-07-28) is pinned by hash in MANIFEST.sha256.
